-- Öl Nu — 🏟️ ARENOR: the arenas of scripts/sport-venues.json become check-in places (CONTRACT "ARENOR · matchpins, glöd och incheckning").
-- Additive data: upsert into bars_lite with type 'arena' and the stable id 'a-<slug of the venue name>' (the same ids as
-- docs/arenas.json, which js/bars.js loads), so check-ins, pins (olnu_near_bar, 110 m for arenas, migration 0105), crowd counts,
-- heat, squad, passport, meriter and the morning paper treat an arena like a bar. Generated by scripts/arena-places-sql.py from
-- docs/arenas.json (scripts/arena-outlines.mjs; positions © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL); re-run it when the list grows.
-- NOTE for a bars_lite re-import from bars.json + bars-extra.json: keep rows with type 'arena' (ids "a-…") active.

